{"content":[{"c":["JACHIN AND BOAZ*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Names of two pillars Solomon set up before the temple vestibule. He named the south pillar Jachin and the north pillar Boaz (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.7.21","r":"1Kgs.7.21","rawR":"1Kgs.7.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.7.21","value":"1Kgs.7.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 7:21"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.3.17","r":"2Chr.3.17","rawR":"2Chr.3.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.3.17","value":"2Chr.3.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 3:17"},"). These hollow pillars were cast of bronze and measured about 27 feet (8.2 meters) in height and about 18 feet (5.5 meters) in circumference (nearly 6 feet, or 1.8 meters, in diameter). They were crowned with a capital (ornate cap or top) about 7½ feet (2.3 meters) high that consisted of cast lily work, chains, and 200 pomegranates each (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.7.15-20","r":"1Kgs.7.15-20","rawR":"1Kgs.7.15-20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.7.15-20","value":"1Kgs.7.15-20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 7:15-20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.3.15-16","r":"2Chr.3.15-16","rawR":"2Chr.3.15-16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.3.15-16","value":"2Chr.3.15-16"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 3:15-16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.4.13","r":"2Chr.4.13","rawR":"2Chr.4.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.4.13","value":"2Chr.4.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"4:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"JachinandBoaz","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 7:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.7.21","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.7.21","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.7.21"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 3:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.3.17","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.3.17","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.3.17"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 7:15-20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.7.15-20","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.7.15-20","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.7.15-20"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 3:15-16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.3.15-16","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.3.15-16","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.3.15-16"},{"anchorText":"4:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.4.13","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.4.13","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.4.13"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"21e0de5196f10420ccf607259dd09dc345e951b962aae131b7b933137533ceeb","sourceItemName":"JachinandBoaz","sourceItemOrder":27,"sourceMember":"Articles/J.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"JachinandBoaz","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Jachin and Boaz*","title":"Jachin and Boaz*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}